Scenario "completion_navigation_and_resize"
Command "CARGO_BIN_EXE_maqi"
Env PATH "/nonexistent"
Terminal rows 6 cols 40
Cursor row 6 col 1

Step "start at the bottom"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |········································|
  r01 |········································|
  r02 |········································|
  r03 |········································|
  r04 |········································|
  r05 |maqi>···································|

Step "open completion"
Input "kubectl "
Input tab
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl···························|
  r01 |>·alpha··········Commands·for·features·…|
  r02 |··annotate·······Update·the·annotations…|
  r03 |··api-resources··Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r04 |··api-versions···Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r05 |··apply··········Apply·a·configuration·…|

Step "move selection down repeatedly"
Input down 3
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl···························|
  r01 |··alpha··········Commands·for·features·…|
  r02 |··annotate·······Update·the·annotations…|
  r03 |··api-resources··Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r04 |>·api-versions···Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r05 |··apply··········Apply·a·configuration·…|

Step "widen with the selection preserved"
Resize rows 6 cols 80
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl···································································|
  r01 |··alpha··········Commands·for·features·in·alpha·································|
  r02 |··annotate·······Update·the·annotations·on·a·resource···························|
  r03 |··api-resources··Print·the·supported·API·resources·on·the·server················|
  r04 |>·api-versions···Print·the·supported·API·versions·on·the·server,·in·the·form·of…|
  r05 |··apply··········Apply·a·configuration·to·a·resource·by·filename·or·stdin·······|

Step "move to the last visible candidate"
Input down
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl···································································|
  r01 |··alpha··········Commands·for·features·in·alpha·································|
  r02 |··annotate·······Update·the·annotations·on·a·resource···························|
  r03 |··api-resources··Print·the·supported·API·resources·on·the·server················|
  r04 |··api-versions···Print·the·supported·API·versions·on·the·server,·in·the·form·of…|
  r05 |>·apply··········Apply·a·configuration·to·a·resource·by·filename·or·stdin·······|

Step "narrow with the selection preserved"
Resize rows 6 cols 40
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl···························|
  r01 |··alpha··········Commands·for·features·…|
  r02 |··annotate·······Update·the·annotations…|
  r03 |··api-resources··Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r04 |··api-versions···Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r05 |>·apply··········Apply·a·configuration·…|

Step "move back to the first candidate"
Input up 4
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl···························|
  r01 |>·alpha··········Commands·for·features·…|
  r02 |··annotate·······Update·the·annotations…|
  r03 |··api-resources··Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r04 |··api-versions···Print·the·supported·AP…|
  r05 |··apply··········Apply·a·configuration·…|

Step "accept and keep typing at the input cursor"
Input enter
Input "X"
Settle 250ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl·alpha·X···················|
  r01 |········································|
  r02 |········································|
  r03 |········································|
  r04 |········································|
  r05 |········································|
